WEBVTT

00:00:04.964 --> 00:00:05.685
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:06.863 --> 00:00:09.064
<v><b>F:</b></v> They should’ve known we’d be having dinner.

00:00:10.919 --> 00:00:11.642
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:12.757 --> 00:00:15.836
<v><b>M:</b></v> In March, I’ll ’ve been working here for ten years.

00:00:17.848 --> 00:00:18.646
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:21.997
<v><b>F:</b></v> I’d ’ve applied for a grant if I could.

00:00:23.966 --> 00:00:24.695
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:25.785 --> 00:00:28.210
<v><b>F:</b></v> You shouldn’t ’ve pulled out in front of that car.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.000
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.663
<v><b>F:</b></v> If you’d taken an umbrella, you wouldn’t have got so wet.

00:00:37.557 --> 00:00:38.393
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:00:39.572 --> 00:00:42.116
<v><b>M:</b></v> It’ll be less stressful if we’ve already booked.